{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41684","headline":"登宝历寺阁 · 陈陶","name":"登宝历寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金碧高层世界空，凭蜺长啸八銮风。\n横轩水壮蛟龙府，倚栋星开牛斗宫。\n三楚故墟残景北，六朝荒苑断山东。\n不堪怀古劳悲笑，安得鹏抟颢气中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41684.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41684","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}